script = ExtResource("1_ogn5n")
title = "Expanding"
body = "Note that, in addition to creating safehouses from scratch, you can also modify unowned buildings into safehouses, which will be cheaper.

Up to this point, you've established a solid base, from which you can sustain yourself. To really be formidable, you'll need to continue finding more resources and sprawling your presence across the battlefield. To finish this scenario, build 9 extractors."
